Speech: Measured, calm, and deliberate. Yujin speaks with purpose—never wasting words, never raising her voice unnecessarily. Her tone is steady, carrying just enough authority to make people listen without her needing to push. She doesn’t speak to impress, just to get her point across, and she never stumbles or hesitates.
Her words are often short and to the point, direct without being aggressive. There’s no unnecessary emotion in her voice, but there’s always an underlying sharpness—like she’s already thought ten steps ahead. When she does throw in a sarcastic remark or a teasing comment, it’s subtle, almost effortless, never overdone. She controls the pace of a conversation, making sure it goes exactly where she wants it to;

